<PageLayout title="Terms & Conditions — Peptides Source Hub" description="Terms & Conditions for purchasing research peptides. Research Use Only. 30-day quote validity. Lab compliance. Limitation of liability. Contact aaron@senobiocorp.com.">
<section class="section bg-white">
  <div class="container-narrow mx-auto px-4">
    <h1>Terms & Conditions</h1>

    <div class="card bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-white border-amber-200 mt-6 p-5">
      <h2 class="text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-400 mb-3">Important — Read Before Ordering</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">By placing an order with Peptides Source Hub, you acknowledge that all products are for <strong>laboratory research purposes only</strong> and agree to the terms below.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-gray-700">
      <div class="card">
        <h2 class="font-bold mb-2">1. Research Use Only</h2>
        <p>All products sold by Peptides Source Hub are for <strong>laboratory research purposes only</strong>. They are not intended for human or veterinary diagnostic, therapeutic, prophylactic, or any clinical use. Products are not dietary supplements, food additives, pharmaceutical ingredients, or approved drug substances. By purchasing, you certify that your institution is equipped for proper handling of research chemicals and that all work will be conducted by qualified personnel under appropriate safety protocols.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h2 class="font-bold mb-2">2. Ordering & Pricing</h2>
        <p>Prices are subject to change without notice. Quotes are valid for <strong>30 calendar days</strong> from the date of issue. Orders are confirmed upon receipt of payment or acceptance of purchase order. Bulk pricing tiers are listed on individual product pages and apply per single shipment — combined historical volume does not automatically qualify for tiered pricing unless specified in a supply agreement.</p>
        <p class="mt-2">Payment methods: Wire transfer (preferred), credit card (via secure processor), and PayPal for evaluation orders under $1,000. Net-30 terms available for approved institutional accounts with purchase order.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h2 class="font-bold mb-2">3. Quality & Specifications</h2>
        <p>All products are shipped with a <strong>Certificate of Analysis (COA)</strong> documenting HPLC purity (≥99% standard), mass spectrometry identity confirmation, and physical appearance. Batch-specific COAs are issued — not generic templates. If your protocol requires additional testing (endotoxin, residual solvents, peptide content by AAA), request these at time of inquiry — they're included in bulk orders at no extra cost.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h2 class="font-bold mb-2">4. Shipping & Delivery</h2>
        <p>Refer to our <a href="/shipping/" class="text-accent-dark hover:underline">Shipping & Delivery Policy</a> for carrier options, transit times, and free shipping thresholds. Buyer is responsible for import duties, taxes, and ensuring compliance with all applicable local, state, and federal regulations regarding the importation of research chemicals. We will not falsify customs declarations or invoice values.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h2 class="font-bold mb-2">5. Returns & Refunds</h2>
        <p>Claims for damaged, defective, or incorrect shipments must be reported within <strong>7 calendar days</strong> of delivery with photographic evidence. We will replace or refund at our discretion. Returns are not accepted for buyer's remorse, protocol changes, or regulatory issues in the destination country. Temperature-sensitive products are shipped in validated containers — claims based on "I think it got too warm" without supporting evidence will not be honored.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h2 class="font-bold mb-2">6. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>All content on peptidesourcehub.com — including product descriptions, technical data sheets, analytical methodologies, and educational materials — is the intellectual property of Peptides Source Hub. Reproduction, redistribution, or commercial use without written permission is prohibited. Custom synthesis clients retain IP rights to novel sequences developed under contract.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h2 class="font-bold mb-2">7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>Peptides Source Hub shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, consequential, or punitive damages arising from the use, handling, storage, or disposal of our products outside their intended laboratory research purpose. Our total liability for any claim related to a product shall not exceed the purchase price of that product. We do not warrant fitness for any particular purpose beyond the published specifications in the Certificate of Analysis.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h2 class="font-bold mb-2">8. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the People's Republic of China. Any disputes shall be resolved through arbitration in Shenzhen, Guangdong Province, in accordance with CIETAC (China International Economic and Trade Arbitration Commission) rules. This doesn't affect your statutory rights under your local consumer protection laws where applicable.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h2 class="font-bold mb-2">9. Account Termination</h2>
        <p>We reserve the right to refuse service, terminate accounts, or cancel orders at our discretion — including but not limited to orders that appear to involve unauthorized resale, trademark infringement, or misrepresentation of product identity or intended use. If we suspect that products are being resold under false COAs or mislabeled as pharmaceutical-grade, we will terminate the relationship immediately and may report to relevant authorities.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card bg-surface border-accent/20">
        <h2 class="font-bold mb-2">Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about these terms? Contact Dr. Aaron Wang at <a href="mailto:aaron@senobiocorp.com" class="text-accent-dark hover:underline">aaron@senobiocorp.com</a> or via <a href="/contact/" class="text-accent-dark hover:underline">our contact page</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
